":\"【再见】\"},\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你是来看书的还是看店的啊？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e好吧，其实是我老公他有收集旧书的癖好，可自己又不赚钱…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e所以我就开了这么个店，没办法，要生活的嘛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于「万文集舍」】\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e看上哪本了么，这边结账。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"f00bxsrucpnT1731896332767\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e推荐啊，读诗的话《天衡绝倒集》卖的还不错，比较符合大众口味。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e外来人的话看看《绝云闻记》吧？如果你胆子不是太小的话。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【有推荐的书吗？】\"},\"l7kb7t9kdT1731896341454\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e看样子，你胆子还挺大的嘛，那你可以看看这本《绝云记闻 · 石兽》。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你要是想看就拿走吧，哪天看腻了再还给我就行了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…反正我已经见多了有借无还的顾客了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"513\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/17/181950745/1f58b8a550f228b366ac707b877e892c_3101634910266356811.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"绝云记闻·石兽\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/513/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/513/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/17/181950745/1f58b8a550f228b366ac707b877e892c_3101634910266356811.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e绝云记闻·石兽\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【《绝云记闻》？】——获得《绝云记闻》·石兽\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e自己挑吧，看上哪本在这边结账。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/18/288180982/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_8121076252075920207.png\",\"option\":\"【我想买些书】——打开商店界面\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e【胜利】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e怎么还有这样的情况…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【失败】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哼，没人来买书的时候我都在琢磨这个呢，你别想轻松过关。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/18/288180982/cc2a44c2e85425afbbd461e49fe0875d_5867748001699235226.png\",\"option\":\"【冒险挑战】——进行七圣召唤对局【牌手四级解锁】\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"1f4ip8oskk9iT1731896388756\":[],\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"f00bxsrucpnT1731896332767\",\"1f4ip8oskk9iT1731896388756\"],\"f00bxsrucpnT1731896332767\":[\"l7kb7t9kdT1731896341454\"],\"l7kb7t9kdT1731896341454\":[],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1737045108","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","p